 "sentences": [
  "A Hawaiian sailor fought for the Union.",
  "James Wood Bush joined the Navy in 1864.",
  "He served on the USS Vandalia during the blockade.",
  "After an injury, he traveled through New England and the Pacific.",
  "He later settled on Kauai, working as a tax collector.",
  "Bush eventually converted to Mormonism.",
  "In 1905, he finally received a government pension for his service."
